# Phase 7: Project Documentation

## Project Name
FitBuddy

## Introduction
FitBuddy is a fitness assistance application designed to help users manage their fitness activities and receive suitable fitness guidance.

## Purpose
The purpose of FitBuddy is to make fitness planning easier for users, especially beginners.

## Benefits

- Easy to use
- Provides fitness guidance
- Helps users plan their workouts
- Saves time
- Provides a simple fitness platform
- Helps users maintain fitness goals

## Technologies Used

- Python
- FastAPI
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Visual Studio Code

## How the Application Works

The user first opens the FitBuddy application. The user enters the required fitness information and selects a fitness goal. The information is sent to the backend. The backend processes the information and generates a suitable fitness recommendation. The result is then displayed to the user.

## Future Enhancements

- User login and registration
- Database integration
- Personalized diet plans
- Exercise videos
- Progress tracking
- AI-based recommendations
- Mobile application
- Fitness reminders

## Conclusion

FitBuddy aims to provide a simple and useful platform for people who want to improve and manage their fitness activities.
